Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.68,0:00:12.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I... I...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.64,0:00:24.59,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't want to lose either. To any of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.07,0:00:27.39,Default,,0,0,0,,This one's mine!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.09,0:00:35.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I won...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.55,0:00:36.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I actually won!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.90,0:00:37.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.88,0:00:40.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Good for you, Sis.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.19,0:00:44.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Was it fun running with them?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.80,0:00:47.70,Default,,0,0,0,,So fun that you forgot about me?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.79,0:00:58.15,Default,,0,0,0,,How... could I...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.30,0:01:00.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.15,0:01:03.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm a terrible sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.10,0:01:05.31,Default,,0,0,0,,I could feel my heart pounding...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.28,0:01:08.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Even though my heart is supposed to be yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.00,0:01:15.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I had so much fun... running with them...\NI felt so happy!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.75,0:01:19.72,Default,,0,0,0,,And because of that...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.85,0:01:27.17,Default,,0,0,0,,I forgot... about you.
