Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.51,0:03:03.26,Title2,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1600,960)\3c&HCB21DB&\fad(450,450)}Episode 3: Reason to Run
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.20,0:03:07.80,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the ocean!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.80,0:03:08.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.92,0:03:11.80,Default,,0,0,0,,It's beautiful... We're getting close to the training campsite.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.80,0:03:14.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah! I can't wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.55,0:03:16.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Me neither!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.10,0:03:33.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Top Road-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.71,0:03:38.22,Default,,0,0,0,,We're here! It's time to get off.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.65,0:03:44.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you feeling sick from the bus ride?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.40,0:03:47.50,Default,,0,0,0,,No, I was just thinking to myself...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.50,0:03:50.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm okay. Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.00,0:04:08.64,Default,,0,0,0,,It's only the first day.\NWhy don't you go enjoy yourself for a bit?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.15,0:04:10.75,Default,,0,0,0,,No, it's alright.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.75,0:04:13.90,Default,,0,0,0,,We're starting with\Nthe sprint, right? I'm good to go!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.00,0:04:19.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Ready, and... go!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.45,0:04:26.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Her body's too tense—\Nit's making her form stiffer than usual.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.36,0:04:28.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Relax as you run!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.30,0:04:30.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.30,0:04:37.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like this is gonna be a tough one.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.50,0:04:47.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Um, how was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.85,0:04:50.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Why don't we call it a day?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.00,0:04:51.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? But...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.60,0:04:55.90,Default,,0,0,0,,You're only gonna get hurt\Nif you push yourself too hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.20,0:04:58.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's work on getting our usual pace back.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.80,0:05:00.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh... I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.85,0:05:04.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Rest up tomorrow too.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.85,0:05:07.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Take a breather and refresh yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.26,0:05:09.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.40,0:05:17.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, that's super cute!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.10,0:05:20.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's see. Where else would be nice...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.00,0:05:21.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.15,0:05:24.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Ayabe-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.41,0:05:29.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Over here! Let's take a picture together!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.94,0:05:33.00,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no better time to get a good shot than at sunset!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.70,0:05:39.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Ayabe-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.95,0:05:40.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Leave me alone!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.95,0:05:47.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't want to take any pictures.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.00,0:06:04.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I bet Trainer-san's really disappointed with me...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.70,0:06:10.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I should be training harder than ever right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.00,0:06:17.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I ran my best at the Derby.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.31,0:06:20.00,Default,,0,0,0,,But my best wasn't enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.30,0:06:23.56,Default,,0,0,0,,That’s why I've got to work harder.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.56,0:06:24.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I have to keep running...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.25,0:06:26.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.10,0:06:27.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa, Prez!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.17,0:06:33.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.34,0:06:36.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you okay, Prez?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.66,0:06:39.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Y-Yes, I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.70,0:06:40.80,Default,,0,0,0,,By the way,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.50,0:06:42.30,Default,,0,0,0,,is this...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.28,0:06:46.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh.... It was supposed to be a surprise,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.66,0:06:48.80,Default,,0,0,0,,but I guess the cat's out of the bag now.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.20,0:06:52.12,Default,,0,0,0,,We're making another banner for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.12,0:06:55.12,Default,,0,0,0,,We wanna really show\Nour support for the next race!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.10,0:06:57.80,Default,,0,0,0,,For me?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.50,0:07:00.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.60,0:07:03.25,Default,,0,0,0,,We're just doing it 'cause we want to!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.25,0:07:07.46,Default,,0,0,0,,You're always helping us out\Nwith schoolwork and stuff. It means a lot!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.20,0:07:09.85,Default,,0,0,0,,You're amazing, Prez.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.40,0:07:12.82,Default,,0,0,0,,You're gonna be great in the next race, I know it!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.35,0:07:16.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you so much!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.16,0:07:19.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll make sure to keep going!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.00,0:07:21.16,Default,,0,0,0,,That's our number one prez!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.81,0:07:24.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks for helping me fold this back up!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.69,0:07:30.25,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right. I have to keep going.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.48,0:07:39.15,Default,,0,0,0,,More... More, more, more!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.75,0:07:50.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Focus!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.45,0:07:52.90,Default,,0,0,0,,One, two. One, two.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.90,0:07:55.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Trainer-san told me to take a break...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.70,0:07:58.40,Default,,0,0,0,,but I know I have to keep\Nputting in my best effort!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.30,0:08:02.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't let everyone down in the next one!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.50,0:08:06.85,Default,,0,0,0,,All right. I'll do what I can!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.63,0:08:41.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? Hey, look. It's Top Road-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.87,0:08:44.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Top Road-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.65,0:08:47.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you go to a festival?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.39,0:08:48.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.20,0:08:52.53,Default,,0,0,0,,There was one at a shrine nearby.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.30,0:08:55.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you in the middle of training?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.85,0:08:57.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Nice work!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.15,0:09:02.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to make sure my performance in the next race is worth watching!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.08,0:09:06.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, it always is! You were so close at the Derby!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.95,0:09:09.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah... Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.15,0:09:13.54,Default,,0,0,0,,You're gonna win the next one for sure! So—mrgh!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.45,0:09:18.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Um, we bought some fireworks earlier.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.95,0:09:20.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you want to join us?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.55,0:09:22.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks for the invite.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.40,0:09:26.94,Default,,0,0,0,,But, I should prepare for tomorrow, so maybe next time!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.88,0:09:31.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Top Road-san...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.60,0:09:34.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Yum! More please, Rice!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.65,0:09:36.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, o-okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.06,0:09:45.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess Ayabe-san's not coming back today either.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.35,0:09:48.80,Default,,0,0,0,,It's up to me to stop her tomorrow!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.45,0:09:50.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Otherwise...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.56,0:09:54.20,Default,,0,0,0,,She's gonna break down...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.03,0:10:07.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Good for you, Onee-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.35,0:10:12.32,Default,,0,0,0,,You met some worthy rivals, ran with them, and then you basked in the glory of victory.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.30,0:10:14.35,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.26,0:10:17.32,Default,,0,0,0,,You looked like you were having so much fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.32,0:10:20.42,Default,,0,0,0,,When I saw how happy you were, I…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.42,0:10:21.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.65,0:10:25.67,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry I'm such a horrible sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.77,0:10:31.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry... I'm so sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.52,0:10:36.47,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't... make... the same mistake again.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.08,0:10:49.35,Default,,0,0,0,,I wanted her to have some time to cool down...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.35,0:10:52.20,Default,,0,0,0,,but I guess she can't help\Npracticing even while on break.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.30,0:10:56.30,Default,,0,0,0,,No use telling her she can't—\Nthat'd just stress her out even more.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.45,0:11:00.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Just who are you running for right now?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.62,0:11:06.31,Default,,0,0,0,,What to do...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.90,0:11:09.60,Default,,0,0,0,,To help her relax, we could...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.80,0:11:11.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.85,0:11:14.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Come to think of it, we're not the only\Nones here for a summer training camp.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.80,0:11:22.55,Sign,,0,0,0,,{\frz342.1\fs30\c&H000000&\move(1457.5,525,1445,507.5,4,2715)}Umamusume Junior Training Club training camp
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.10,0:11:27.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Oho.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.80,0:11:30.66,Default,,0,0,0,,My, oh, my. What a dilemma.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.66,0:11:36.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa! Um... Uh... Wh-What is?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.39,0:11:41.60,Default,,0,0,0,,It appears my ambitions are clouding the light of others.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.25,0:11:46.75,Default,,0,0,0,,However, I can do naught but wait patiently.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.75,0:11:50.00,Default,,0,0,0,,As such, it wouldn't do for her to stop\Nbefore she reaches the light in which I stand.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.65,0:11:53.15,Default,,0,0,0,,My ambitions are too great to be contained.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.15,0:11:54.03,Default,,0,0,0,,They're—
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.28,0:12:02.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa! I-I'm so sorry! I shouldn't have tossed it around like that!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.77,0:12:05.39,Alt,,0,0,0,,Handkerchief! We need a handkerchief right away!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.72,0:12:09.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Even soda cannot help but overflow before me!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.55,0:12:11.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.47,0:12:17.93,Default,,0,0,0,,In any case, Top Road-san\Nmust shine for both our futures.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.55,0:12:24.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, that shouldn't be too much of a problem for her.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.53,0:12:29.37,Default,,0,0,0,,However, there is one other light I need.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.55,0:12:36.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Though, I'm afraid she may be walking too close to the edge.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.10,0:12:43.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Hi everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.85,0:12:47.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm Narita Top Road, your coach for today!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.30,0:12:49.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Nice to meet you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.10,0:12:52.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.17,0:12:58.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's get started with some\Nwarm-up exercises, shall we?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.20,0:13:00.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Watch closely and try to copy me!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.45,0:13:02.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.01,0:13:06.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, first.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.92,0:13:09.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's check each of your forms by—
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.80,0:13:13.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, I'd like to see you run, Coach!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.03,0:13:14.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Me too!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.15,0:13:17.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure thing. I'll run a quick lap then!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.37,0:13:38.85,Default,,0,0,0,,You're so cool, Coach!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.85,0:13:40.91,Default,,0,0,0,,You really went zoooom at the end!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.21,0:13:43.81,Default,,0,0,0,,I wanna zoom like that too! How do you do it?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.80,0:13:48.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, I guess we can practice zooming together!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.39,0:13:55.00,Default,,0,0,0,,All right! Get ready to zoom, everyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.00,0:13:57.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Zoooom!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.38,0:14:03.63,Default,,0,0,0,,After we're done eating, we'll be heading to the beach for some more practice!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.63,0:14:05.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.45,0:14:22.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Bye, Coach!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.76,0:14:24.67,Default,,0,0,0,,See you next time!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.15,0:14:30.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Nice work out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.50,0:14:31.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Trainer-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.32,0:14:36.85,Default,,0,0,0,,That suits you a lot more, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.85,0:14:37.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.00,0:14:41.00,Default,,0,0,0,,That smile. It's been a while since I saw it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.55,0:14:44.55,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.55,0:14:46.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I've always been smiling.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.42,0:14:50.06,Default,,0,0,0,,The camp was a great refresher too...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.06,0:14:51.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that the truth?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.24,0:14:57.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, it has to be... right?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.66,0:15:03.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone's cheering me on and telling me\NI can win the next one. They all believe in me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.25,0:15:09.44,Default,,0,0,0,,It wouldn't make sense for me to still be down in the dumps.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.45,0:15:15.06,Default,,0,0,0,,So I'm fine now. I can—
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.50,0:15:18.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Then why're you making that face?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.01,0:15:19.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.70,0:15:28.51,Default,,0,0,0,,You're right. I look awful.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.15,0:15:32.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm no good.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.45,0:15:35.36,Default,,0,0,0,,All I do is worry you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.36,0:15:38.11,Default,,0,0,0,,You can worry me all you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.25,0:15:41.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm your trainer, aren't I?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.15,0:15:49.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm scared... of betraying everyone's trust in me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.70,0:15:51.00,Default,,0,0,0,,What if I lose again?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.45,0:15:55.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't want to disappoint\Nall the people cheering me on.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.86,0:16:00.40,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't know if you'll lose the next one.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.40,0:16:04.75,Default,,0,0,0,,You know better than anyone else that I was in my best condition at the Derby!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.30,0:16:08.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Yet... I still lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.00,0:16:12.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Ever since that day, I can't help but think...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.38,0:16:15.40,Default,,0,0,0,,What if I don't improve?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.12,0:16:18.37,Default,,0,0,0,,I might never be able to win again.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.15,0:16:21.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to do my best.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.22,0:16:23.55,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to fulfill everyone's expectations of me!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.55,0:16:24.25,Default,,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.80,0:16:27.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm just so scared!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.12,0:16:30.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm so weak...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.80,0:16:33.65,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't deserve their support.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.35,0:16:38.30,Default,,0,0,0,,It is not winning...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.60,0:16:42.20,Default,,0,0,0,,even after putting in your best effort.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.65,0:16:46.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Even so, you haven't said you'll quit.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.10,0:16:53.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Even after losing, you continued looking for a way to win.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.65,0:16:59.20,Default,,0,0,0,,You put your whole heart into moving forward,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.35,0:17:02.65,Default,,0,0,0,,without stopping even once.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.66,0:17:08.80,Default,,0,0,0,,You might lose and fall—but you keep on fighting.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.35,0:17:12.28,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the Narita Top Road I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.95,0:17:16.60,Default,,0,0,0,,But... But what if I keep losing?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.25,0:17:19.60,Default,,0,0,0,,They won't want to cheer for me anymore...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.44,0:17:19.60,Alt,,0,0,0,,They will!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.50,0:17:23.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone's showing their support because you're Narita Top Road.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.45,0:17:27.70,Default,,0,0,0,,You keep fighting... and that's why they'll keep cheering you on.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.65,0:17:30.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Trainer-san...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.65,0:17:34.39,Default,,0,0,0,,You did well.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.81,0:17:35.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.55,0:17:38.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.94,0:17:55.69,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry you had to see\Nthat embarrassing side of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.03,0:17:59.10,Default,,0,0,0,,But I feel a bit better...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.98,0:18:02.00,Default,,0,0,0,,after crying like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.30,0:18:07.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Then how about unwinding even more tonight?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.78,0:18:09.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Unwinding?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.24,0:18:10.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Yep.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.62,0:18:27.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone from the shopping\Ndistrict is here. But why?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.05,0:18:32.81,Default,,0,0,0,,When I told them you were feeling down,\Nthey all immediately came out here.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.34,0:18:38.04,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right! We heard from the trainer himself!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.04,0:18:43.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't be a stranger! You tell us when you're feeling blue, you hear?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.41,0:18:44.70,Default,,0,0,0,,You guys...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.15,0:18:47.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? Your eyes are looking red.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.40,0:18:51.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh well! The carrots are really sweet, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.20,0:18:53.70,Default,,0,0,0,,W-Wait! I'm still...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.70,0:18:55.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's get some warm food in you!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.10,0:18:59.00,Default,,0,0,0,,What took you so long, Prez!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.80,0:19:01.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh... you are the prez, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.53,0:19:05.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Fantastic! We just got everything grilled.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.60,0:19:08.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Here you go! Some grilled carrot topped with cheese!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.35,0:19:13.15,Default,,0,0,0,,This yakisoba here's got a ton of carrot mixed in too!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.15,0:19:16.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Everything looks so good!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.15,0:19:16.17,Default top,,0,0,0,,Ooh, I want some too!\NSave some for me! Look at that cheese!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.17,0:19:18.52,Default,,0,0,0,,It's amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.52,0:19:20.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Have some, Prez!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.52,0:19:20.00,Default top,,0,0,0,,It does look really good. I'd like some too...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.97,0:19:21.92,Default top,,0,0,0,,Time to dig in!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.92,0:19:23.20,Default top,,0,0,0,,Bon appetit.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.20,0:19:24.24,Default,,0,0,0,,It's delicious!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.20,0:19:24.24,Default top,,0,0,0,,This is delicious!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.24,0:19:26.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Here, have some of this!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.57,0:19:27.80,Default,,0,0,0,,And this too!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.65,0:19:33.00,Default,,0,0,0,,You guys... Thank you so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.00,0:19:38.10,Default,,0,0,0,,No need to thank us.\NEveryone loves you, Top Road.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.10,0:19:39.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Do your best in the next race too!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.96,0:19:43.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Win the preliminary race and get that Kikuka Sho!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.18,0:19:45.60,Default,,0,0,0,,You guys...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.10,0:19:48.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess I didn't need to be so scared after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.00,0:19:53.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone, you're all cheering me on so wholeheartedly.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.35,0:19:56.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll do my best.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.40,0:20:00.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Very, very best! I'll do nothing but my best!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.00,0:20:02.77,Default,,0,0,0,,We get the message, Prez!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.99,0:20:09.25,Sign,,0,0,0,,{\c&HCB21DB&\move(865,352.5,955,552.5,7,2218)}Fight on, Top Road!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.65,0:20:11.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm so happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.91,0:20:16.85,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll be running against Ayabe-san again at the next GII race...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.60,0:20:20.90,Default,,0,0,0,,But I received so much energy\Nfrom everyone today.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.40,0:20:23.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I can keep doing my best!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.53,0:20:39.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry... I'm sorry...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.85,0:20:42.72,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't have to apologize so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.72,0:20:44.15,Default,,0,0,0,,You had fun, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.85,0:20:46.15,Default,,0,0,0,,That's good.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.35,0:20:48.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.95,0:20:53.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, but that leg is only going to make it to the Kikuka Sho.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.40,0:21:01.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Only to the Kikuka Sho?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.70,0:21:04.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Does that mean... it's going to break down there?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.00,0:21:07.65,Default,,0,0,0,,I always thought it strange.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.52,0:21:11.35,Default,,0,0,0,,The doctors told me there was nothing wrong...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.55,0:21:15.30,Default,,0,0,0,,But then, why does it hurt so much?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.40,0:21:25.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I get it now. So I am getting punished after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.74,0:21:28.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Fine. You can break it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.74,0:21:32.99,Default,,0,0,0,,If the Kikuka Sho is going\Nto be my last... then so be it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.35,0:21:36.62,Default,,0,0,0,,The victories, the cheers...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.15,0:21:38.70,Default,,0,0,0,,All of it is yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.10,0:21:41.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll win for your sake.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.90,0:21:44.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I will... give you everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.20,0:21:55.90,Default,,0,0,0,,They're rounding the fourth turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.90,0:21:58.00,Default,,0,0,0,,All that's left is the final sprint to the finish line!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.65,0:22:01.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Admire Vega advances to the outside!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.22,0:22:03.80,Default,,0,0,0,,She's emerging from the rear and closing in fast!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.65,0:22:05.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I knew it'd come to this!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.00,0:22:10.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Narita Top Road picks up the pace!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.14,0:22:12.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Admire Vega continues charging ahead!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.80,0:22:15.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Will this be another Derby?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.10,0:22:17.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Ayabe-san's a tough opponent.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.95,0:22:19.25,Default,,0,0,0,,She's strong...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.75,0:22:21.50,Default,,0,0,0,,but I'm not giving up!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.20,0:22:29.40,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not... over yet...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.40,0:22:30.67,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not the end!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.67,0:22:34.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Narita Top Road is pushing!\NShe's pushing forward! She's pushing...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.25,0:22:37.35,Default,,0,0,0,,but just like at the Derby,\NShe's not enough to win!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.35,0:22:40.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Admire Vega remains victorious!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.45,0:22:40.35,Alt,,0,0,0,,Oh...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.60,0:22:44.35,Default,,0,0,0,,It really did turn out just like the Derby...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.35,0:22:47.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Right... It's gotta be tough for Top Road.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.96,0:22:50.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Top Road...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.45,0:22:53.30,Default,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.70,0:22:55.00,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not over!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.73,0:23:00.45,Default,,0,0,0,,After this, I'll talk to Trainer-san about\Nwhat I felt were my weak points this time around...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.55,0:23:04.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Ayabe-san! Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.00,0:23:12.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Narita Top Road... is back to being herself.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.75,0:23:13.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Ayabe-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.10,0:23:20.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I knew it. You're really strong, Ayabe-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.20,0:23:22.00,Default,,0,0,0,,This is incredibly challenging for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.80,0:23:27.92,Default,,0,0,0,,That's exactly why...\NI'd like to race against you again.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.50,0:23:33.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Just wait. I'll run even better at the Kikuka Sho!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.77,0:23:44.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Ayabe-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.55,0:23:47.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't care how you run.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.30,0:23:50.43,Default,,0,0,0,,All I need to do is win.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.55,0:23:59.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Ayabe-san...

